{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048863 :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100991 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100686 :question/math-academy-id "e-4378" :question/problem "Calculate $A-(B-C),$ where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}-(\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-1-0 & -1-(-5) \\\\ 2-1 & 0-1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1-(-1) & 0-4 \\\\ 2-1 & -2-(-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101106 :question/math-academy-id "q-11476" :question/problem "Calculate $A + B + C$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101132 :question/math-academy-id "q-13542" :question/problem "Calculate $D - (E - F)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$D=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$F=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292852 :question/math-academy-id "q-275408" :question/problem "Calculate $C+D-E$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$D=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$C+D-E=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C+D-E & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3+2-6 & 5+(-4)-5 \\\\ 5+4-(-4) & -1+1-2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -4 \\\\ 13 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295084 :question/math-academy-id "q-279525" :question/problem "Calculate $A+B-C$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$A+B-C=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B-C & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4+2-1 & -1+3-5 \\\\ 0+(-2)-3 & 5+4-(-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -3 \\\\ -5 & 10\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295085 :question/math-academy-id "q-279526" :question/problem "Calculate $X+Y+Z$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Z=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$X+Y+Z=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X+Y+Z & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0+(-2)+3 & 5+1+(-1) \\\\ 7+4+(-1) & -2+3+2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 10 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295086 :question/math-academy-id "q-279527" :question/problem "Calculate $A-(B-C)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$A-(B-C)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-(\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 3\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}3-1 & 5-2 \\\\ 0-6 & -4-3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -6 & -7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4-2 & -2-3 \\\\ 7-(-6) & 1-(-7)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 \\\\ 13 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295087 :question/math-academy-id "q-279528" :question/problem "Calculate $X+(Y-Z)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 8 \\\\ 3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Z=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$X+(Y-Z)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X+(Y-Z) & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+(\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 8 \\\\ 3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}9-2 & 8-3 \\\\ 3-1 & 7-4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4+7 & 6+5 \\\\ 2+2 & 5+3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}11 & 11 \\\\ 4 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335989 :question/math-academy-id "q-69636" :question/problem "Calculate $R+S+T$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$S=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -5 \\\\ 12 & -8 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$T=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R+S+T & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -5 \\\\ 12 & -8 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3+7+3 & -3+(-5)+0 \\\\ -4+12+0 & 2+(-8)+7 \\\\ -1+5+0 & -5+(-3)+2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -8 \\\\ 8 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549167 :question/problem "Calculate $C+D-E$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$D=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 9 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 8 \\\\ -7 & -7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$C+D-E=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C+D-E & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 9 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 8 \\\\ -7 & -7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+3-(-7) & 0+9-8 \\\\ -2+1-(-7) & 3+(-1)-(-7)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}11 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549172 :question/problem "Calculate $A-(B-C)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & -9 \\\\ -1 & -7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$A-(B-C)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & -9 \\\\ -1 & -7\\end{bmatrix}-(\\begin{bmatrix}9 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -9\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & -9 \\\\ -1 & -7\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}9-0 & -1-0 \\\\ 0-0 & 7-(-9)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & -9 \\\\ -1 & -7\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}9 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 16\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-9-9 & -9-(-1) \\\\ -1-0 & -7-16\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-18 & -8 \\\\ -1 & -23\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549181 :question/problem "Calculate $A+(B-C)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & -1 \\\\ 8 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ -7 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$A+(B-C)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+(B-C) & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}+(\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & -1 \\\\ 8 & 6\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ -7 & -4\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-9-3 & -1-6 \\\\ 8-(-7) & 6-(-4)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-12 & -7 \\\\ 15 & 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+(-12) & 8+(-7) \\\\ 1+15 & -4+10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 & 1 \\\\ 16 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549186 :question/problem "Calculate $C-(D-E)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -4 \\\\ 8 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$D=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 \\\\ -9 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$C-(D-E)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C-(D-E) & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -4 \\\\ 8 & -1\\end{bmatrix}-(\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 5\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 \\\\ -9 & -2\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -4 \\\\ 8 & -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}4-(-2) & 6-0 \\\\ 7-(-9) & 5-(-2)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -4 \\\\ 8 & -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 6 \\\\ 16 & 7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2-6 & -4-6 \\\\ 8-16 & -1-7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & -10 \\\\ -8 & -8\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Sum or Difference of Three or More Matrices"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100992 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100687 :question/math-academy-id "e-4379" :question/problem "Find $A+C-(B+A)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ -6 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+C-(B+A) & =A+C-B-A \\\\  & =\\cancel{A}+C-B-\\cancel{A} \\\\  & =C-B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C-B & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ -6 & 1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3-3 & -1-(-1) \\\\ 1-2 & 2-0 \\\\ -6-(-4) & 1-1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101130 :question/math-academy-id "q-13535" :question/problem "Find $Q + R - (Q + P)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Q=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 6 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101131 :question/math-academy-id "q-13536" :question/problem "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-C-(B-C) & =A+B-C-B+C \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233433 :question/math-academy-id "q-13550" :question/problem "Find $K+L-(K+J)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$J=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$K=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$L=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 6 \\\\ 6 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}K+L-(K+J) & =K+L-K-J \\\\  & =\\cancel{K}+L-\\cancel{K}-J \\\\  & =L-J\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L-J & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 6 \\\\ 6 & 6\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6-5 & 6-2 \\\\ 6-2 & 6-1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269058 :question/math-academy-id "q-13543" :question/problem "Find $M+O-(N+M)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$O=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 6 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M+O-(N+M) & =M+O-N-M \\\\  & =\\cancel{M}+O-N-\\cancel{M} \\\\  & =O-N\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}O-N & =\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 6 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}8-1 & 6-4 \\\\ 5-2 & 3-(-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295093 :question/math-academy-id "q-279581" :question/problem "Find $A+B-(C+B)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & -2 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$A+B-(C+B)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B-(C+B) & =A+B-C-B \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-C-\\cancel{B} \\\\  & =A-C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-C & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}8 & -2 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2-8 & -5-(-2) \\\\ 7-(-4) & 0-1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -3 \\\\ 11 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335986 :question/math-academy-id "q-69623" :question/problem "Find $G+H-(H+F)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$F=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$G=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 4 & -5 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$H=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}G+H-(H+F) & =G+H-H-F \\\\  & =G+\\cancel{H}-\\cancel{H}-F \\\\  & =G-F\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}G-F & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 4 & -5 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5-2 & 4-(-1) & -5-2 \\\\ 1-3 & -2-4 & 2-1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 & -7 \\\\ -2 & -6 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335987 :question/math-academy-id "q-69627" :question/problem "Find $C+V-(N+C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}10 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 25 \\\\ -57 & -23\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$V=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 3 \\\\ 6 & -4 \\\\ -1 & -8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -6 \\\\ 3 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C+V-(N+C) & =C+V-N-C \\\\  & =\\cancel{C}+V-N-\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =V-N\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}V-N & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 3 \\\\ 6 & -4 \\\\ -1 & -8\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -6 \\\\ 3 & 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5-1 & 3-(-7) \\\\ 6-2 & -4-(-6) \\\\ -1-3 & -8-5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 10 \\\\ 4 & 2 \\\\ -4 & -13\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186520625 :question/problem "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 9 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 7 \\\\ 2 & 9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-C-(B-C) & =A+B-C-B+C \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 9 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186520628 :question/problem "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 9 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ 9 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 7 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-C-(B-C) & =A+B-C-B+C \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 9 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186520629 :question/problem "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 9 \\\\ 4 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-C-(B-C) & =A+B-C-B+C \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 9 \\\\ 4 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186520642 :question/problem "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ 8 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 7 \\\\ 6 & 9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-C-(B-C) & =A+B-C-B+C \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ 8 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186520651 :question/problem "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-C-(B-C) & =A+B-C-B+C \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186567275 :question/problem "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 7 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 8 \\\\ 6 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A+B)-C-(B-C) & =A+B-C-B+C \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 7 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186567285 :question/problem "Find $(A-C)-(A-B)+C$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 8 \\\\ 8 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 4 \\\\ 7 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 9 \\\\ 8 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A-C)-(A-B)+C & =A-C-A+B+C \\\\  & =\\cancel{A}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{A}+B+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B & =\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 4 \\\\ 7 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186567291 :question/problem "Find $A-(C+A)+(C+B)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 8 \\\\ 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(C+A)+(C+B) & =A-C-A+C+B \\\\  & =\\cancel{A}-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{A}+\\cancel{C}+B \\\\  & =B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 8 \\\\ 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186567300 :question/problem "Find $(B+A)-(C+B)+C$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 9 \\\\ 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(B+A)-(C+B)+C & =B+A-C-B+C \\\\  & =\\cancel{B}+A-\\cancel{C}-\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{C} \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186567306 :question/problem "Find $A-(B-C)-(A-B)$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 7 \\\\ 8 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 8 \\\\ 8 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C)-(A-B) & =A-B+C-A+B \\\\  & =\\cancel{A}-\\cancel{B}+C-\\cancel{A}+\\cancel{B} \\\\  & =C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C & =\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 8 \\\\ 8 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186567308 :question/problem "Find $(B+A)-(B-C)-A$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 7 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 8 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(B+A)-(B-C)-A & =B+A-B+C-A \\\\  & =\\cancel{B}+\\cancel{A}-\\cancel{B}+C-\\cancel{A} \\\\  & =C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single matrix. So, the result is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ 8 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Sum or Difference of Three or More Matrices Using Distributivity"}] :topic/title "Properties of Matrix Addition"}
